---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, HAS_PHONE } from '../config';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={`Thank You | ${SITE.brand}`}
  description="Thank you. We have your request and we will be in touch."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section style="min-height:46vh">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;text-align:center;padding:40px 0">
      <h1>Thank you, we have your request</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.12rem">Someone will be in touch with you shortly.{HAS_PHONE && (
        <> If it is easier, call us directly on <a href={SITE.phoneHref}><strong>{SITE.phone}</strong></a>.</>
      )}</p>
      <p>It helps to have a few things ready when we speak: roughly how big the tree is, whether it is
      leaning, dead or already down, how close it stands to a structure or power line, and how
      wide the access to the yard is. Those answers get us most of the way to a real figure.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:30px"><a class="cta" href="/">Back to the homepage</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
